begin="00:30.427" end="00:34.394"><span begin="00:30.427" end="00:30.644">I </span><span begin="00:30.644" end="00:30.917">want </span><span begin="00:30.917" end="00:31.195">you </span><span begin="00:31.195" end="00:31.517">with </span><span begin="00:31.517" end="00:31.884">me </span><span begin="00:31.884" end="00:32.218">on </span><span begin="00:32.218" end="00:32.596">this </span><span begin="00:32.596" end="00:33.085">road </span><span begin="00:33.085" end="00:33.452">to </span><span begin="00:33.452" end="00:33.827">the </span><span begin="00:33.827" end="00:34.394">sky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.932" end="00:39.040"><span begin="00:34.932" end="00:35.126">We'll </span><span begin="00:35.126" end="00:35.312">be </span><span begin="00:35.312" end="00:35.800">shining </span><span begin="00:35.800" end="00:36.294">every </span><span begin="00:36.294" end="00:37.073">night </span><span begin="00:37.073" end="00:37.416">I </span><span begin="00:37.416" end="00:38.096">promise </span><span begin="00:38.096" end="00:39.040">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.688" end="00:42.112"><span begin="00:39.688" end="00:40.016">Just </span><span begin="00:40.016" end="00:40.384">me </span><span begin="00:40.384" end="00:40.776">and </span><span begin="00:40.776" end="00:42.112">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.360" end="00:44.456"><span begin="00:42.360" end="00:42.568">Oh </span><span begin="00:42.568" end="00:42.832">I </span><span begin="00:42.832" end="00:43.360">promise </span><span begin="00:43.360" end="00:44.456">you</span></p></div></body></tt>